== Usage ==

=== Creating New Entity Instances ===

```mediawiki
{{Entity
 |Type=Concept
 |Name=Knowledge Graph
 |Has definition=A network of entities and relationships
 |Has domain=Knowledge Representation
 |Has epistemic status=Established
}}
```

=== Querying by Epistemic Status ===

```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::Established]] [[Has domain::Ontology]]
 |?Has definition
 |format=table
}}
```

=== Visualizing Relationships ===

<pre class="mermaid">
graph TD
    A[Agent] -->|"Creates"| C[Construct]
    C -->|"Depends On"| I[Invariant]
    I -->|"Used In"| P[Protocol]
</pre>

